&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Claude (Anthropic) for business workflows — including prompt design, Cowork or API-based automation, or deploying Claude within team tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in management consulting (top-tier firm) or corporate strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to global or multi-regional program delivery across time zones and regulatory environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with B2B payments, treasury management, or cross-border settlement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PMP, PgMP, or equivalent certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Ripple Treasury&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ripple is the leading provider of crypto solutions for businesses, helping financial institutions move money globally with speed, transparency, and cost-effectiveness. Our Treasury team sits at the center of that mission — managing the capital and operational infrastructure that makes real-time global payments possible. You’ll join a high-performing, passionate team where your work has direct impact on how the global financial system evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role works alongside a peer Director-level Program Manager and reports to the Head of Program Management within Treasury. You’ll have the scope, sponsorship, and autonomy to drive meaningful transformation.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
