&lt;li&gt;You will deliver outstanding results for our customers and are a role model for other engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a shared vision and build and maintain strong partnerships with Product Management, Ops, Security, Research, Customer Success, and Business development teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for the entire software development process for your team’s work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and deliver your roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
