&lt;li&gt;Direct experience building or operating a &lt;strong&gt;double-entry ledger or core accounting/financial system&lt;/strong&gt; — journals, debits/credits, chart of accounts, balance derivation, reversals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record with &lt;strong&gt;correctness-critical, high-throughput transactional systems&lt;/strong&gt;: idempotency design, concurrency control (optimistic locking / conditional writes), and balance-integrity guarantees under concurrent writes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering closely with team members — revenue recognition, intercompany accounting, GL mapping, reconciliation, and ERP integration (e.g., Oracle)&lt;/li&gt;
