&lt;li&gt;Bonus: familiarity with crypto custody and multi-network asset movement (wallets, blockchain networks, exchanges) given the ledger&#39;s (asset, network) balancing model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of defining and owning a technical roadmap across multiple product verticals. This includes onboarding additional service areas onto a shared platform rather than focusing on a single product surface.&lt;/li&gt;
