&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Ripple, we’re building a world where value moves like information does today. It’s big, it’s bold, and we’re already doing it. Through our crypto solutions for financial institutions, businesses, governments and developers, we are improving the global financial system and creating greater economic fairness and opportunity for more people, in more places around the world. And we get to do the best work of our career and grow our skills surrounded by colleagues who have our backs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you’re ready to see your impact and unlock incredible career growth opportunities, join us, and build real world value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join Ripple Labs Inc. as the Manager, AI Platform Engineering in Chicago, IL, and spearhead our bold venture in AI platform development! This remarkable opportunity enables you to craft the future of our AI platform, GSmart, powering smart features across our enterprise treasury products. You will be involved in greenfield projects, bringing insight and focus to undefined problems. You will also work hand-in-hand with product and solution teams to convert customer challenges into fluid technical solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the AI platform roadmap and delivery end to end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure platform AI is measurable and dependable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work together with product and solution teams to address real customer challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable teams to build on the platform and own their deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, mentor, and grow the platform ai engineering team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay actively involved and contribute to architecture and full-stack production code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of software engineering experience, including full-stack development and AI/ML platform infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of engineering management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong full-stack development skills — front-end through back-end and APIs — with solid cloud infrastructure experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating AI systems in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, current command of AI and modern LLM/GenAI infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
