&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3+ years&lt;/strong&gt; in client-facing consulting, treasury/risk technology implementations, or SaaS delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of treasury and financial risk management: debt, FX and interest rate derivatives, hedge accounting, and accounting workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to analyze complex business challenges and build creative, scalable client solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong solution architecture and business process design chops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communicator — you translate complex concepts into clear, compelling business value&lt;/li&gt;
