&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who Thrives Here:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is built for someone who is:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Energized by complexity&lt;/strong&gt; — not intimidated by it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative&lt;/strong&gt; in how they solve problems and architect solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;natural multi-tasker&lt;/strong&gt; who keeps multiple workstreams moving with clarity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Confident&lt;/strong&gt; enough to lead clients through ambiguity and change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driven to deliver results&lt;/strong&gt; — and proud of the impact they create&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
