&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experienced and proficient in application development guidelines, cloud architecture, and deployment&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Deep expertise in ASP.NET/Core and C#, with advanced knowledge of Microsoft SQL Server&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with Azure Services, Azure DevOps, and designing and implementing CI/CD pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Extensive experience building web applications using modern JavaScript frameworks, with a strong grasp of TDD and BDD practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Proven track record to influence and mentor developers within an agile team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Skilled in reviewing and estimating user stories as part of an agile delivery process&lt;/li&gt;
