&lt;li&gt;Proven track record building or significantly transforming a legal operations function and a builder&#39;s mentality — this role requires writing the playbook, not following one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading or supporting AI, automation, or data-driven transformation initiatives within a legal department&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data and analytics skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing outside counsel relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacity for managing budgets, timelines, and team members, with a sharp eye for detail and follow-through&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly effective interpersonal skills with the ability to collaborate across all levels inside and outside the organization and a focus on building trusted relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embodies a positive “get it done” attitude that is receptive to feedback, pushes for excellence, and inspires others to overcome challenges&lt;/li&gt;
