&lt;li&gt;8+ years in operations supporting payment services, trading, or middle office, with at least 2–4 years in a leadership capacity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A sharp eye for detail and the ability to stay organized and solve problems in a fast-moving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with payment services, collections, markets, and instruments (e.g. OTC, crypto, derivatives) and core reconciliation principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working in Google and Microsoft applications (ideally Excel and VBA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and/or supporting connectivity with banks, exchanges, or crypto platforms&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to automation initiatives and SQL query creation for daily operations is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
