&lt;li&gt;Experience measuring and improving key reliability metrics (MTTR, MTTD, availability, error budgets) at an organizational level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python or Bash scripting experience in addition to PowerShell.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Jira for incident tracking and workflow automation.&lt;/li&gt;
